# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Built after the title song (music/title.scrim). The darkest: a theremin singing the toy tune a
# note a bar (E F G Bb...), cracked by the chords under it, a bell tolling, a choir.
title    Abyss
composer Claude
about    Black glass islands over nothing at all, the darkest of them: a theremin singing the toy tune a note a bar, bent and cracked by the tritone chords under it, a bell tolling, a low choir, glass harmonica chords and a low E that never moves; the glass bird's calls are half steps. When something is near, a cracked crystal ostinato ticks over a glass heartbeat, far thunder and a low tom; a kit and the tune come back as it comes for you, a horn, drive and breaking glass for a fight, choir and gong for a guardian.
tempo    56
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.45

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead voices ost pad bass bird
# mood treasure: ost pad bird wonder
# mood sense:    crack heart thunder toms pad bass bowl
# mood rise:     sense -bowl lead kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -heart -toms horn drive war smash
# mood boss:     fight -lead choir gong

voice lead     theremin   vol=0.42 pan=-0.1 glide=0.3
voice voices   voices     vol=0.22 pan=0.1  center=E3 att=0.8 rel=1.2
voice ost      bell       vol=0.16 pan=0.3  rev=0.8
voice pad      glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=-0.25 center=A3 att=0.4 rel=0.8
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.7  glide=0.08
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.7
voice wonder   crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.35 rev=0.6
voice crack    crystal    vol=0.4  pan=-0.3
voice heart    glasstap   vol=0.3  pan=0.1
voice thunder  thunder    vol=0.2
voice toms     tomlo      vol=0.42 pan=-0.25
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.28 pan=0.15 rev=0.6
voice kick     kick       vol=0.5
voice snare    snare      vol=0.36 pan=0.1
voice horn     horn       vol=0.7  pan=0.2  oct=-1 att=0.025 rel=0.12 rev=0.3 glide=0.08
voice drive    strings    vol=0.38 pan=0.3  gate=0.5 att=0.015 rel=0.08 rev=0.25
voice war      tommid     vol=0.5  pan=0.15 rev=0.2
voice smash    shatter    vol=0.35 pan=-0.2
voice choir    voices     vol=0.28 center=D3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice gong     gong       vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

